program	set_each_mutate_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: `s` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: result of `insert` is `Result<Bool, AllocError>` and is silently discarded"
log	"  --> examples/set_each_mutate_error.saw:9:6"
log	"    |"
log	" 9 |     s.insert(1)"
log	"    |      ^"
log	"   hint: handle it — `match` it, `try`/`try!`/`try?` it, or return it — or write `let _ = ...` to discard it explicitly"
log	""
log	"error: exclusive access violation: `s` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/set_each_mutate_error.saw:10:15"
log	"     |"
log	" 10 |     s.each { [&var s] e in"
log	"     |               ^"
log	"   hint: disjoint access paths are allowed (e.g. `&var p.x` with `&p.y`); give the mutable reference exclusive access"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
